Package: envirolipids
Type: Package
Title: Predict NPP from brGDGT data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Marco A.", "Vidal-Cordasco", 
           email = "mav54@cam.ac.uk",  
           role = c("aut", "cre")),            
    person("Andrea", "Manica", 
           email = "am315@cam.ac.uk", 
           role = "aut")
  )
Description: A tool to predict Net Primary Productivity (NPP) from relative
    abundance of individual brGDGTs using centered log-ratio (CLR)
    transformation and a pre-trained random forest model. Includes diagnostic
    tools to assess whether new samples fall within the brGDGT composition
    space of the training data, identifying potentially unreliable
    predictions. When mean annual temperature and total annual precipitation are
    available, the package also computes potential NPP using the Miami and
    Thornthwaite Memorial models, expressed by default in grams of carbon so
    that they are comparable with the brGDGT-based estimates.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), randomForest, stats
